  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Progress Bar control is used to display the progress of a task or operation with rich customization options. It supports linear and circular types, determinate and indeterminate modes, segmented progress, gradient colors, labels, custom content, animation, and multiple theme support. It can be used to indicate file uploads, loading states, step-based workflows, and task completion in forms and interactive ASP.NET Core web applications.",
